Title: DebugSwift Network Simulation & Mocking (Operational Mode)
participant "QA / Developer"
participant "DebugSwift In-App UI"
participant "Injection Manager"
participant "Rule Storage"
participant "App Network Layer"

"QA / Developer"->"DebugSwift In-App UI": Enable Response Rewrite (Rule: VIP Profile)
"DebugSwift In-App UI"->"Rule Storage": Persist RewriteRule (URL: "/api/user", Status: 200)
"DebugSwift In-App UI"->"Injection Manager": setRewriteConfig(enabled: true)
"App Network Layer"->"Injection Manager": Evaluate Outgoing Request (/api/user)
"Injection Manager"->"Injection Manager": Rule Match: Exact URL & HTTP GET
"Injection Manager"-->"App Network Layer": Return Mocked Payload & Status 200 OK
"App Network Layer"-->"DebugSwift In-App UI": Stream Intercepted Event & Payload Diff
"DebugSwift In-App UI"-->"QA / Developer": Display In-App Floating Toast & Badge "MOCKED"
